\f0\fs24 \cf0 This is a surf and golf trip almost nobody knows exists, but it'll blow your mind. Here's how to spend six days surfing and playing world-class golf on a tropical island in China. And getting here is easier than you think. Visa-free for Australians and Americans with direct flights from Sydney and Melbourne. After landing in Hainan, take our private executive van to the wave pool and check into a five-star resort just steps from the waves. For three days, surf the world's only tropical island wave pool in the morning. Play the Dunes in the afternoon, the best links course in China and one of Asia's finest seaside layouts. Surf, golf, repeat. In between, explore the coast, visit coffee plantations, enjoy local cuisine, surf the ocean when it turns on, and discover over two thousand years of island culture. Then head to Mission Hills, check into the Ritz Carlton and play Blackstone. Once a world top one hundred course played by Tiger Woods and Rory McIlroy. Its black lava fields create one of the world's most distinctive volcanic golf landscapes. Finish your trip with volcanic hot springs, perfect waves, world-class golf, one tropical island. Comment "trip" or send us a DM for the details.}